stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Loading: open
    Loading --> ReadyAll: valid initial response
    ReadyAll --> ReadySelected: choose recorded or unrecorded
    ReadySelected --> ReadyAll: choose all
    ReadySelected --> Loading: refresh or apply server filters
    ReadyAll --> Loading: refresh
    Loading --> ReadySelected: latest response retains choice
    Loading --> ReadyAll: latest response loses choice or is empty
    Loading --> Error: invalid response or read failure
    Error --> Loading: refresh
    Loading --> Loading: stale response ignored
    ReadyAll --> Idle: clear
    ReadySelected --> Idle: clear
    Loading --> Idle: clear
    Idle --> Retired: session invalidated
    Loading --> Retired: session invalidated
    ReadySelected --> Retired: session invalidated
    Retired --> Retired: clear or late response
    Idle --> Disposed: dispose
    Loading --> Disposed: dispose
    ReadySelected --> Disposed: dispose
    Disposed --> Disposed: late response
